      "asset_url": null,
      "asset_sha256": null,
      "sheet": null,
      "row_index": null,
      "page": null,
      "raw_text": "A full-thickness circumferential incision was made through the outer rectal wall approximately 1.5–2 cm proximal to the dentate line using an ultrasonic scalpel. Traction sutures were placed at each quadrant of the distal rectal stump."
    },
