      "asset_url": null,
      "asset_sha256": null,
      "sheet": null,
      "row_index": null,
      "page": null,
      "raw_text": "The rectum and sigmoid colon were inferiorly retracted. The outer prolapsed layer was everted caudally, followed by mesorectal dissection along the bowel wall with preservation of the mesorectum. The prolapsed segment was subsequently straightened under tension."
