      "raw_text": "The prolapsed bowel segment was resected. End-to-end coloanal anastomosis was completed using interrupted full-thickness sutures. The anastomotic site was reduced intra-anally. An alginate calcium-Vaseline gauze drain was inserted transanally and secured with sterile gauze dressing."
